# RX-003: An active metal releases hydrogen from acid; copper is the control
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 1000mL
add v1 HCl 0.004mol
add v1 Mg 0.001mol
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100mL
seal v2 1000mL
add v2 HCl 0.004mol
add v2 Cu 0.001mol
inspect v2
